    "description": "<p>The martial artist's twisting gestures and fluid footwork evoke the slippery, mutable ways that moonsilver shapes Essence. When the character uses this Charm, opponents cannot precisely determine the Sidereal's location. Essence bends and flows like moonsilver around her, enabling her to make an unarmed Martial Arts attack against anyone within (her Essence x 5) yards. The target of such an attack subtracts the attacker's Martial Arts score from his DV.</p>",
